# Bow of Nylea's fourth mode, "up to four target cards": it is one instance of "target", so one card cannot be chosen
# for two of the four (CR 115.3). The graveyard holds Lightning Bolt and Burst Lightning; after the Bolt is chosen for the
# first slot, it is not a candidate for the second (the refusal), and Burst Lightning is (the positive control). The
# controller orders the two (Burst Lightning first, so it lies above the Bolt) as they go under the Forest.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Burst Lightning
Bow of Nylea
Forest
Forest

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

